WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.770
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.040 --> 00:02.040
F*ck!

3
00:02.270 --> 00:03.490
you've already become one.

4
00:03.770 --> 00:05.130
How would you still have bad luck?

5
00:07.500 --> 00:08.450
Mungkorn.

6
00:09.940 --> 00:11.260
Take him back home for a visit.

7
00:11.290 --> 00:14.120
If there's any misunderstanding, talk it out.

8
00:14.140 --> 00:15.840
Why you always have cat food with you.

9
00:15.860 --> 00:16.910
You're just like a cat.

10
00:17.530 --> 00:19.030
That's why you attract them.

11
00:23.000 --> 00:24.580
Can you please call me...

12
00:24.600 --> 00:26.420
Thear the way your mom calls me?

13
00:26.530 --> 00:27.480
Goodnight,

14
00:28.990 --> 00:29.960
Thear.

15
00:36.060 --> 00:37.160
Hey.

16
00:38.460 --> 00:39.890
You woke up for a run without even telling me.

17
00:40.570 --> 00:42.610
I saw you were still asleep,

18
00:42.770 --> 00:43.600
so I didn't want to wake you.

19
00:43.800 --> 00:45.740
I guess I was having a really good dream.

20
00:46.310 --> 00:49.310
Cause someone cuddled me last night, I ended up sleeping in.

21
01:08.820 --> 01:10.530
Why are you in such a rush?

22
01:10.660 --> 01:11.700
How about another lap?

23
01:11.890 --> 01:12.690
That's enough for me.

24
01:13.410 --> 01:15.090
Come on, run with me for just one more lap.

25
01:15.120 --> 01:16.070
You go run by yourself.

26
01:16.090 --> 01:17.800
Let's go together. Please?

27
01:29.730 --> 01:31.110
Look at you.

28
01:31.630 --> 01:33.130
Are you trying to get a chance to hug me?

29
01:33.580 --> 01:35.440
Wasn't all that cuddling last night enough for you?

30
01:35.800 --> 01:37.360
There's no need to pretend to fall.

31
01:40.410 --> 01:41.910
It was an accident.

32
01:42.340 --> 01:43.540
You're talking nonsense.

33
01:44.780 --> 01:46.970
Getting scolded by you in the morning really wakes me up.

34
01:47.260 --> 01:48.650
I feel like I could run another hundred kilometers.

35
01:48.690 --> 01:50.870
- Let's go run together. - Then go run by yourself.

36
01:51.430 --> 01:52.500
I'm heading home.

37
02:00.480 --> 02:01.420
Hey!

38
02:02.160 --> 02:02.930
Hey!

39
03:14.510 --> 03:15.660
Where are we now?

40
03:16.210 --> 03:17.440
We've reached Chiang Mai.

41
03:17.640 --> 03:19.020
In Chiang Mai already?

42
03:20.640 --> 03:22.010
I only dozed off for a second.

43
03:22.040 --> 03:23.930
Three hours is just a second to you?

44
03:24.670 --> 03:27.350
You just left me driving all by myself.

45
03:27.920 --> 03:30.290
But it's okay. Watching you sleep was actually nice.

46
03:35.820 --> 03:36.880
Inspector.

47
03:36.940 --> 03:37.620
See?

48
03:38.630 --> 03:39.700
I've already told you

49
03:39.730 --> 03:42.310
to call me Thear.

50
03:45.740 --> 03:46.770
Thear...

51
03:47.530 --> 03:50.490
Would you mind if we made a stop first?

52
03:50.730 --> 03:53.320
The shop is right on the way home.

53
03:53.440 --> 03:54.640
What kind of shop is that?

54
03:55.550 --> 03:56.500
A shaved ice place.

55
03:57.380 --> 04:00.790
Does that mean this whole trip wasn't sweet enough?

56
04:01.790 --> 04:03.360
The sweetness from Thear

57
04:03.600 --> 04:05.400
might not be good for my health.

58
04:05.660 --> 04:07.050
But I think the sweets here

59
04:07.630 --> 04:09.780
are the best.

60
04:10.630 --> 04:11.870
Of course.

61
04:12.040 --> 04:14.710
Wherever you want to eat, I'll take you.

62
04:15.280 --> 04:18.960
When it comes to spoiling his boyfriend, nobody does it better than Thear.

63
04:34.860 --> 04:37.030
Oh, it's closed.

64
04:37.460 --> 04:38.660
I've been wanting to eat here.

65
04:39.580 --> 04:41.250
Do you really want to have it that badly?

66
04:41.340 --> 04:42.370
Should we go somewhere else?

67
04:42.970 --> 04:44.010
It's fine.

68
04:44.230 --> 04:45.450
I just really like this place.

69
04:46.120 --> 04:48.450
Sometimes it's not about the taste.

70
04:48.570 --> 04:50.110
It's more about the vibes.

71
04:55.120 --> 04:56.190
Alright.

72
04:57.100 --> 04:58.650
I'll bring you back another day then,

73
04:59.060 --> 04:59.700
okay?

74
05:02.070 --> 05:03.380
Let's head back.

75
05:04.530 --> 05:05.200
Okay.

76
05:21.090 --> 05:24.070
(Yin as Theartha)

77
05:29.010 --> 05:31.740
(War as Mungkorn)

78
05:35.880 --> 05:38.230
(Shane as Phuwin)

79
05:38.660 --> 05:41.700
(Boss as Lukplub)

80
05:44.080 --> 05:45.810
(Krit as Kanin)

81
05:46.070 --> 05:48.020
(Tang as Nadol)

82
05:51.500 --> 05:56.740
(Tay as Saming)

83
06:43.510 --> 06:44.810
Hello, Sinthawee.

84
06:45.190 --> 06:46.310
How are you, Thear?

85
06:46.820 --> 06:48.550
Are you well-rested yet?

86
06:49.170 --> 06:51.530
If you are, it's time to get back to work.

87
06:51.550 --> 06:52.550
What?

88
06:54.210 --> 06:55.340
Back to...?

89
06:55.360 --> 06:57.460
Am I really going back to work?

90
06:57.480 --> 06:58.270
(Yes.)

91
06:58.390 --> 07:00.500
(The autopsy results are finally out.)

92
07:00.680 --> 07:03.160
(Ronnaphop's last molar)

93
07:03.200 --> 07:04.700
had poison hidden inside it.

94
07:05.190 --> 07:08.610
(He intended to break that tooth to commit suicide.)

95
07:09.050 --> 07:09.980
And now,

96
07:10.620 --> 07:13.260
you've been cleared of the charges.

97
07:13.550 --> 07:15.540
Understood, sir. Thank you so much.

98
07:15.740 --> 07:17.360
I'm so ready to get back to work now.

99
07:18.010 --> 07:18.790
(And one more thing.)

100
07:19.740 --> 07:22.110
Don't forget to thank Mungkorn.

101
07:22.140 --> 07:23.780
The moment he arrived at the station,

102
07:23.870 --> 07:27.070
he rushed to get those autopsy results for you.

103
07:30.970 --> 07:32.470
Yes, sir. I will.

104
07:33.090 --> 07:34.670
I'll go thank Mungkorn as well.

105
07:34.750 --> 07:36.260
Thank you, Uncle.

106
07:36.870 --> 07:37.600
Oh,

107
07:37.950 --> 07:39.780
the intel reports that

108
07:40.100 --> 07:44.060
the Black Bull drug has effects similar to a date rape drug.

109
07:44.560 --> 07:47.620
(Initially, it causes intoxication.)

110
07:47.640 --> 07:48.900
But after a while,

111
07:48.920 --> 07:52.340
it triggers an uncontrollable, intense sexual arousal.

112
07:52.450 --> 07:54.340
If you spot anyone with those symptoms,

113
07:54.360 --> 07:58.310
you could assume that they've taken the Black Bull drug.

114
07:58.420 --> 07:59.250
(Copy that, sir.)

115
07:59.370 --> 08:01.800
(I'll give it my best this time.)

116
08:01.820 --> 08:02.460
Good.

117
08:04.090 --> 08:05.050
All set.

118
08:06.510 --> 08:08.690
You really seem to care about him.

119
08:10.340 --> 08:11.960
Well, he's my boss.

120
08:14.120 --> 08:15.680
But thank you anyway, sir.

121
08:36.370 --> 08:37.040
Whoa!

122
08:38.050 --> 08:38.840
Hey!

123
08:40.190 --> 08:40.910
Wow!

124
08:43.330 --> 08:44.890
Hunglay!

125
08:47.510 --> 08:48.270
I missed you.

126
08:48.580 --> 08:49.820
I missed you so much.

127
09:02.070 --> 09:04.650
I wish I were a bike.

128
09:04.890 --> 09:08.590
So I could get all those kisses, hugs, and cuddles from you.

129
09:10.470 --> 09:12.870
I called to get them to speed up the delivery.

130
09:14.480 --> 09:15.620
Thank you so much.

131
09:15.870 --> 09:18.350
I finally have a bike to ride to work.

132
09:18.800 --> 09:19.420
What?

133
09:20.000 --> 09:22.350
Do you mean we won't go to work together anymore?

134
09:22.370 --> 09:23.870
I'm finally getting back to work, you know.

135
09:25.590 --> 09:28.150
Well, congratulations on that.

136
09:29.650 --> 09:31.380
Oh, acting all happy for me?

137
09:31.490 --> 09:33.670
Weren't you the one who helped me?

138
09:38.440 --> 09:39.900
But I'm curious now,

139
09:41.110 --> 09:43.660
did you help me as a subordinate,

140
09:44.310 --> 09:47.250
or as a husband?

141
09:50.170 --> 09:51.020
Well.

142
09:52.000 --> 09:53.540
Maybe a bit of both.

143
09:54.680 --> 09:56.070
My mom taught me that

144
09:56.090 --> 10:00.450
when you're under someone's roof, you should be helpful.

145
10:03.750 --> 10:05.620
I don't really need you to be helpful.

146
10:06.280 --> 10:08.290
I much prefer you helping me with something else.

147
10:16.950 --> 10:19.540
You're completely twisting the idea,

148
10:19.740 --> 10:21.890
making something meaningful seem ambiguous.

149
10:22.680 --> 10:25.240
Since it's here, why don't we take it for a ride?

150
10:25.910 --> 10:26.710
You sure?

151
10:27.420 --> 10:28.660
Whoa!

152
10:28.830 --> 10:32.440
You'll get to see just how powerful Hunglay really is.

153
10:44.620 --> 10:46.470
He needs to warm up a bit. He might not be used to Chiang Mai.

154
10:56.140 --> 10:57.500
Let's go.

155
10:58.490 --> 10:59.600
Hold tight.

156
11:00.110 --> 11:01.060
Let's go!

157
11:02.360 --> 11:04.830
♪And you look into my eyes,♪

158
11:04.850 --> 11:09.160
♪It's too much for this heart to keep inside♪

159
11:09.730 --> 11:12.160
♪Almost forgot how to breathe,♪

160
11:12.190 --> 11:14.650
♪How could you do this to me?♪

161
11:14.670 --> 11:20.240
♪Told you to stop, but you wouldn't agree♪

162
11:20.670 --> 11:23.180
♪With all the evidence I have found,♪

163
11:23.210 --> 11:27.090
♪Guess I'll have to take you into custody now♪

164
11:27.110 --> 11:31.910
♪That level of cuteness is against the law♪

165
11:31.930 --> 11:36.010
♪I must be under your spell, can I blame you at all?♪

166
11:36.040 --> 11:36.980
I told you so.

167
11:37.010 --> 11:38.490
Hunglay is the real deal.

168
11:38.580 --> 11:40.620
Engine's fired up and ready to go.

169
11:41.790 --> 11:42.790
Ready to go?

170
11:43.380 --> 11:45.590
We had to pray just to get it started.

171
11:45.770 --> 11:47.940
He has some tricks

172
11:48.380 --> 11:49.570
that make him more valuable, you know?

173
11:52.860 --> 11:54.020
Just like his owner, right?

174
12:11.450 --> 12:13.220
You weren't even gonna share them?

175
12:13.380 --> 12:14.950
I'm about to choke on these snacks.

176
12:15.150 --> 12:17.020
I actually bought some for you, too.

177
12:19.040 --> 12:19.740
Here.

178
12:20.340 --> 12:21.680
Want me to feed you?

179
12:21.860 --> 12:23.660
That won't be necessary.

180
12:23.830 --> 12:25.040
Careful, you're gonna spill it.

181
12:26.440 --> 12:27.830
Come on. Cheers.

182
12:29.130 --> 12:31.070
Let's celebrate you getting back to work.

183
12:33.420 --> 12:34.480
You got it. Cheers!

184
12:54.430 --> 12:55.980
What are you trying to do?

185
13:05.040 --> 13:06.510
You're eating like a messy little kid.

186
13:14.730 --> 13:15.580
Thank you.

187
13:21.650 --> 13:23.490
You know, ever since we got back from Phayao,

188
13:23.650 --> 13:25.150
I'm not sure if you've noticed,

189
13:25.890 --> 13:27.120
but I feel like I've changed.

190
13:31.000 --> 13:32.060
You've changed?

191
13:35.410 --> 13:37.220
Did you eat more or gain weight?

192
13:37.610 --> 13:38.880
I don't mean that.

193
13:39.080 --> 13:41.120
My body is still as fit as ever. See?

194
13:41.630 --> 13:42.840
I'm still healthy.

195
13:44.260 --> 13:45.590
It's something in my heart.

196
13:46.130 --> 13:47.700
I just feel much happier now.

197
13:48.200 --> 13:49.820
I feel like I'm more fulfilled.

198
13:50.790 --> 13:53.380
Like, I've seen another side of someone.

199
13:55.320 --> 13:57.450
Maybe someone's opening up to me.

200
14:02.310 --> 14:04.270
I've been open this whole time.

201
14:05.640 --> 14:07.040
You just didn't see it.

202
14:10.650 --> 14:12.130
Then keep it open, okay?

203
14:12.930 --> 14:14.000
Because from now on,

204
14:14.530 --> 14:16.660
I won't take my eyes off you.

205
14:48.420 --> 14:49.990
Why did you bring me here?

206
14:50.280 --> 14:51.000
Hey.

207
14:51.310 --> 14:53.960
I've got to take you out for something fun.

208
14:54.180 --> 14:55.970
So you can relax and unwind.

209
14:56.210 --> 14:57.140
A bathhouse?

210
14:57.970 --> 14:59.090
No way.

211
14:59.410 --> 15:00.630
I can shower by myself.

212
15:01.160 --> 15:02.510
What kind of guy do you think I am?

213
15:03.170 --> 15:06.160
Even though I was a playboy and went to those places,

214
15:06.190 --> 15:08.620
I haven't been there ever since I've been with you.

215
15:09.950 --> 15:11.050
That won't be necessary.

216
15:11.600 --> 15:13.980
You should just let someone bathe you like you always do.

217
15:14.010 --> 15:15.800
Come on, that's not happening.

218
15:16.320 --> 15:18.080
The only one who gets to bathe me

219
15:19.520 --> 15:21.010
is you.

220
15:35.280 --> 15:37.080
This is my regular hangout spot.

221
15:37.230 --> 15:39.880
They have pool tables, hot springs, saunas, a gym,

222
15:40.060 --> 15:41.790
and even special massages

223
15:43.370 --> 15:44.360
From the sound of it,

224
15:45.110 --> 15:46.940
this place seems like heaven for you.

225
15:49.560 --> 15:51.470
Do you want to go to heaven with me?

226
15:55.140 --> 15:55.940
Mungkorn!

227
15:56.790 --> 15:58.210
Wait, what?

228
15:59.140 --> 15:59.940
Lukplub.

229
16:00.020 --> 16:01.010
Lukplub.

230
16:01.360 --> 16:02.460
Phuwin.

231
16:02.570 --> 16:03.700
What are you guys doing here?

232
16:04.000 --> 16:06.720
Phuwin was invited to celebrate Thear's return to work.

233
16:06.780 --> 16:09.250
- I see. - And I missed you so much too.

234
16:09.440 --> 16:11.080
I wanted to see how you're doing here.

235
16:11.560 --> 16:12.700
It's good.

236
16:12.930 --> 16:14.440
There's always something exciting here.

237
16:16.530 --> 16:17.820
What about you, Thear?

238
16:18.110 --> 16:20.220
Are you taking good care of my brother like you promised?

239
16:20.540 --> 16:22.640
Well, I just carried him up here.

240
16:22.660 --> 16:24.500
All that's left is to have him sit on my lap.

241
16:25.070 --> 16:25.910
Happy now?

242
16:26.010 --> 16:27.100
That much?

243
16:29.710 --> 16:30.640
And...

244
16:31.030 --> 16:32.160
How did you end up here?

245
16:33.970 --> 16:35.000
I invited him myself.

246
16:35.300 --> 16:37.930
If we work together, we should hang out to get to know each other.

247
16:40.220 --> 16:42.000
Actually, that's not really necessary.

248
16:42.540 --> 16:44.080
I don't want to be that close to you.

249
16:45.020 --> 16:47.650
I think staying in my room and reading books would be better.

250
16:47.820 --> 16:50.480
You just stay cooped up in your room and never meet anyone.

251
16:50.510 --> 16:51.920
No wonder you're still single.

252
16:52.040 --> 16:53.880
I'm single, and I'm fine with it.

253
16:54.440 --> 16:55.630
I enjoy my life.

254
16:56.610 --> 16:58.250
You've got to give it a try.

255
16:58.610 --> 16:59.910
You never know until you try.

256
17:00.690 --> 17:01.360
He's right.

257
17:01.660 --> 17:02.900
You've got to try.

258
17:04.020 --> 17:04.750
Oh.

259
17:05.520 --> 17:07.790
How did you come here with Thear?

260
17:19.790 --> 17:20.570
Well.

261
17:21.700 --> 17:25.520
My place is very close to his, so we just came together.

262
17:26.620 --> 17:27.350
Hold on a second.

263
17:27.630 --> 17:29.190
Aren't you staying at the police flats?

264
17:33.730 --> 17:35.860
The police flats were full.

265
17:35.890 --> 17:38.030
- So I couldn't move in... - Actually, they aren't full.

266
17:38.290 --> 17:39.630
There are plenty of rooms left.

267
17:41.400 --> 17:42.510
What?

268
17:43.360 --> 17:44.990
What's going on here?

269
17:50.290 --> 17:52.370
The flats in Chiang Mai are quite old.

270
17:52.420 --> 17:55.780
I suggested that Mungkorn find a place to rent.

271
17:56.150 --> 17:57.280
That's probably more convenient.

272
17:59.490 --> 18:01.150
Don't make a big deal out of it.

273
18:01.340 --> 18:03.260
We're neighbors.

274
18:03.350 --> 18:05.800
It's normal for us to come together, right?

275
18:06.500 --> 18:07.160
Right.

276
18:12.260 --> 18:13.450
Okay.

277
18:14.310 --> 18:15.080
Okay.

278
18:16.110 --> 18:18.540
Come on, let me practice. I'll rack them up again.

279
18:22.500 --> 18:23.930
Hey, Thear.

280
18:24.270 --> 18:25.990
Do you have a ring on your ring finger?

281
18:26.180 --> 18:27.710
Are you married, or did you just put it there?

282
18:29.200 --> 18:30.190
I...

283
18:31.900 --> 18:33.530
I'm married.

284
18:33.780 --> 18:35.710
Why would I put it there for no reason?

285
18:36.040 --> 18:38.750
When did you get married? Why didn't I know?

286
18:38.860 --> 18:40.320
It's just someone I'm close to.

287
18:44.930 --> 18:45.930
Right, Mungkorn?

288
18:49.180 --> 18:49.920
Hey!

289
18:50.200 --> 18:51.090
What's the deal?

290
18:51.460 --> 18:53.470
How come Mungkorn knows but I don't?

291
18:53.490 --> 18:55.140
Come on, let me see your lover.

292
18:55.390 --> 18:58.700
Can I see Inspector Thear's sweetheart?

293
18:59.260 --> 19:00.750
I have to respect them.

294
19:01.320 --> 19:03.490
If they're not ready,

295
19:03.970 --> 19:05.080
how can I introduce them?

296
19:13.060 --> 19:14.120
Are there any more cues?

297
19:15.040 --> 19:16.650
I want to play billiards too.

298
19:16.670 --> 19:19.360
Yeah, go get one. It's in locker number six back there.

299
19:19.380 --> 19:20.080
Yes.

300
19:22.040 --> 19:23.080
Come on, come on.

301
19:46.100 --> 19:46.820
Hello, there.

302
19:48.130 --> 19:48.730
Yes?

303
19:48.830 --> 19:50.130
Is this your first time here?

304
19:50.340 --> 19:51.640
I've never seen you around.

305
19:52.100 --> 19:53.660
Yes, it's my first time.

306
19:54.830 --> 19:56.110
Are you from here?

307
19:56.900 --> 19:58.700
No, I'm from Phayao.

308
19:59.030 --> 19:59.950
I see.

309
20:00.230 --> 20:02.850
I moved here from Krabi.

310
20:03.180 --> 20:04.950
I wanted a change of scenery.

311
20:05.200 --> 20:06.700
The people here are quite lovely.

312
20:07.650 --> 20:09.110
You've come a long way.

313
20:09.490 --> 20:11.090
From the south all the way to the north.

314
20:11.720 --> 20:13.690
The distance might be great,

315
20:14.300 --> 20:16.720
but our hearts might end up close.

316
20:19.860 --> 20:21.940
My name is North. What's yours?

317
20:22.680 --> 20:24.560
Your name is North, but you're from the south?

318
20:25.180 --> 20:26.500
That's quite a contrast.

319
20:26.880 --> 20:28.270
I'm Mungkorn.

320
20:28.800 --> 20:31.390
Wow, Mungkorn.

321
20:32.200 --> 20:35.940
Such a tough name, but why are you so adorable?

322
20:38.420 --> 20:40.220
Do you want to play a match with me?

323
20:40.380 --> 20:42.420
If you can't play well, I can teach you.

324
20:47.040 --> 20:47.840
Mungkorn.

325
20:48.450 --> 20:49.370
Is something going on?

326
20:50.060 --> 20:51.230
The others are waiting.

327
20:51.470 --> 20:52.450
It's nothing.

328
20:52.840 --> 20:53.680
Please excuse me.

329
21:17.700 --> 21:19.210
Not bad.

330
21:24.650 --> 21:25.450
That's too hard.

331
21:25.860 --> 21:26.830
That yellow ball.

332
21:26.880 --> 21:28.620
That's not an easy one.

333
21:29.220 --> 21:31.180
- It's not that easy. - It's not easy at all.

334
21:56.300 --> 21:57.800
You have such great skin and body.

335
21:58.450 --> 22:00.450
That's why people keep hitting on you.

336
22:01.850 --> 22:03.700
- Who's hitting on me? - That guy.

337
22:04.030 --> 22:05.120
The one at the pool table.

338
22:06.780 --> 22:08.540
He was just being friendly.

339
22:08.720 --> 22:09.820
You can't call that hitting on me.

340
22:10.230 --> 22:11.220
That's exactly your problem.

341
22:11.770 --> 22:13.120
You're so naive.

342
22:13.330 --> 22:15.380
I can tell at a glance

343
22:15.500 --> 22:16.770
he's got his sights

344
22:17.300 --> 22:19.100
set on you.

345
22:19.590 --> 22:20.690
What kind of sights?

346
22:22.100 --> 22:23.840
You're quite the expert at this.

347
22:24.850 --> 22:27.060
Like you always have your sights set on others.

348
22:55.450 --> 22:56.340
Next time,

349
22:57.300 --> 22:58.840
if someone looks at you like this,

350
22:59.780 --> 23:01.240
or touches you like this,

351
23:01.580 --> 23:02.960
I'm stepping right in.

352
23:03.830 --> 23:06.300
I'm the jealous type.

353
23:09.620 --> 23:10.760
That won't be necessary.

354
23:11.650 --> 23:13.710
If anyone tries that and I don't like it,

355
23:14.690 --> 23:16.000
I'll just push them away.

356
23:18.230 --> 23:20.030
So, you haven't pushed me away.

357
23:20.730 --> 23:21.620
Does that mean you like it?

358
23:28.770 --> 23:29.800
What are you doing?

359
23:41.780 --> 23:42.840
Hey, Thear!

360
23:45.630 --> 23:47.630
Get in the water already. What are you waiting for?

361
23:48.320 --> 23:50.190
Yeah, okay. I'll be right there.

362
23:50.490 --> 23:51.290
Right.

363
24:10.350 --> 24:11.150
Hey, Phuwin.

364
24:11.310 --> 24:14.610
You've known Mungkorn since before you transferred to Mae Sai, right?

365
24:15.460 --> 24:16.430
Of course.

366
24:16.640 --> 24:19.880
Thear and I trained him ourselves.

367
24:20.130 --> 24:21.700
I totally forgot

368
24:21.730 --> 24:23.970
that Thear was also called in to train the boots.

369
24:26.110 --> 24:27.230
Mungkorn.

370
24:27.420 --> 24:28.670
Was Thear scary?

371
24:29.020 --> 24:29.990
Not really.

372
24:30.880 --> 24:34.200
He was more like, acting cool and bossy.

373
24:35.600 --> 24:36.990
He wasn't afraid of me.

374
24:37.130 --> 24:39.080
Back then, he had someone protecting him.

375
24:39.560 --> 24:40.470
Wait, what?

376
24:41.070 --> 24:42.000
Who was it?

377
24:44.480 --> 24:45.960
Thear's best friend.

378
24:45.990 --> 24:47.130
Best friend, my a*s.

379
24:47.150 --> 24:50.020
I don't even want to mention that prick.

380
24:52.300 --> 24:53.880
How did you pass

381
24:53.940 --> 24:55.730
the Police Examination when you got tattoos like that?

382
24:56.150 --> 24:58.450
I got them after that.

383
24:58.930 --> 25:01.040
I was thinking of getting more.

384
25:01.090 --> 25:02.360
Wanna get my face tattooed on you?

385
25:02.380 --> 25:04.550
It'll protect you better than a yantra.

386
25:04.570 --> 25:05.600
I'll pass on that.

387
25:05.830 --> 25:06.630
It looks ugly.

388
25:08.330 --> 25:09.250
Take that.

389
25:09.270 --> 25:10.420
How do you like that, Kanin?

390
25:11.410 --> 25:14.080
Someone like you deserves someone like Nadol to shut you up.

391
26:04.980 --> 26:05.710
What's wrong?

392
26:09.670 --> 26:10.640
I'm thirsty.

393
26:11.330 --> 26:13.070
Let me grab a drink.

394
26:13.090 --> 26:13.940
I'm parched.

395
26:32.830 --> 26:33.780
Hello.

396
26:35.560 --> 26:36.480
- Oh! - Hey!

397
26:37.350 --> 26:38.190
You again?

398
26:39.030 --> 26:40.130
Do you work here?

399
26:40.400 --> 26:41.310
Oh, no.

400
26:41.370 --> 26:43.730
The staff went to the restroom, so I'm just helping them.

401
26:43.950 --> 26:45.380
Would you like something to drink?

402
26:46.300 --> 26:48.840
A glass of beer, please.

403
26:48.860 --> 26:51.000
Beer? Sure thing.

404
27:09.880 --> 27:11.650
So, what do you do for a living?

405
27:11.730 --> 27:14.300
I work as a host.

406
27:16.770 --> 27:18.190
I see.

407
27:18.870 --> 27:21.250
You're quite the sweet talker and good at pleasing people.

408
27:22.400 --> 27:25.630
But with your looks, you could definitely do it too.

409
27:26.040 --> 27:27.820
You might even have guests lining up for you.

410
27:28.430 --> 27:29.270
Thanks.

411
27:29.460 --> 27:31.770
But I'll pass. It's not really my thing.

412
27:32.560 --> 27:33.310
No problem.

413
27:33.720 --> 27:35.750
But if you ever change your mind...

414
27:39.570 --> 27:40.480
Here's my card.

415
27:44.770 --> 27:46.300
Here is your beer.

416
27:47.330 --> 27:48.130
Thanks.

417
27:59.700 --> 28:01.120
Please let go of my boyfriend's hand.

418
28:04.510 --> 28:05.310
He's your boyfriend?

419
28:06.020 --> 28:07.850
He didn't mention he had one.

420
28:08.150 --> 28:09.290
Well, he's not my boyfriend.

421
28:10.360 --> 28:11.160
He's my husband.

422
28:17.550 --> 28:18.310
Okay.

423
28:18.860 --> 28:20.290
I see.

424
28:20.570 --> 28:22.750
I'll back off then.

425
28:31.240 --> 28:34.460
See? I told you he was trying to hit on you.

426
28:35.170 --> 28:37.670
If you go around telling people like that,

427
28:37.740 --> 28:38.970
everyone is going to find out.

428
28:39.920 --> 28:41.590
Why not just put it in the headlines?

429
28:41.680 --> 28:43.790
If I could, it'd be a big one.

430
28:44.380 --> 28:47.430
So I can let everyone know that we are

431
28:48.020 --> 28:50.600
husbands.

432
29:02.550 --> 29:05.540
Are you that thirsty?

433
29:59.280 --> 30:00.420
Are you okay?

434
30:00.760 --> 30:01.680
Is it too hot in here?

435
30:03.060 --> 30:04.040
I'm fine.

436
30:05.900 --> 30:08.770
But it feels like I'm burning up from the inside.

437
30:10.750 --> 30:12.640
What do you mean by that?

438
30:14.160 --> 30:15.350
I don't know.

439
30:16.700 --> 30:18.110
I've never felt like this before.

440
30:20.400 --> 30:21.670
You might be sick.

441
30:21.880 --> 30:23.740
Should we head back? I'll take you home.

442
30:24.340 --> 30:25.830
I'm not going back.

443
30:55.700 --> 30:56.810
What are you doing?

444
30:57.710 --> 30:59.110
The others are in the room.

445
31:01.190 --> 31:03.660
You like excitement, don't you?

446
31:04.860 --> 31:06.340
You really wanted it earlier.

447
31:22.220 --> 31:22.910
Stop it.

448
31:25.250 --> 31:26.090
Mungkorn.

449
31:28.900 --> 31:29.850
Stop it.

450
31:35.020 --> 31:35.830
Hey.

451
31:36.190 --> 31:38.690
What's wrong with you two?

452
31:40.120 --> 31:42.000
If you're feeling hot, just go outside.

453
31:44.040 --> 31:46.650
Yeah. It's freaking hot.

454
31:47.890 --> 31:49.240
I can't take it anymore.

455
31:49.970 --> 31:50.930
Excuse me.

456
31:53.410 --> 31:54.580
Hey, Mungkorn.

457
31:58.020 --> 32:01.470
I think Thear took what I said a little too seriously.

458
32:02.400 --> 32:04.750
He's taking really good care of Mungkorn.

459
32:06.380 --> 32:09.560
But I think he's taking it too seriously.

460
32:10.990 --> 32:12.160
What do you mean?

461
32:12.410 --> 32:13.750
I don't know.

462
32:14.840 --> 32:16.110
I think it's strange.

463
32:16.220 --> 32:17.960
They're acting like a couple.

464
32:18.360 --> 32:19.760
I don't think so.

465
32:20.320 --> 32:22.550
He already said he's married.

466
32:22.700 --> 32:25.470
He probably doesn't think of Mungkorn as more than a brother.

467
32:27.180 --> 32:27.870
Is that so?

468
32:30.690 --> 32:31.410
Okay.

469
32:41.060 --> 32:42.110
Hey, Mungkorn.

470
32:42.320 --> 32:44.760
What's wrong with you? You're acting weird.

471
32:45.170 --> 32:46.550
I don't know.

472
32:47.220 --> 32:48.530
I feel so hot inside.

473
32:48.550 --> 32:50.650
And I'm dizzy now.

474
32:57.860 --> 32:59.140
Your body's not hot at all.

475
33:02.580 --> 33:04.250
Hey!

476
33:04.580 --> 33:05.600
Mungkorn!

477
33:06.330 --> 33:07.280
What has gotten into you?

478
33:07.490 --> 33:09.110
You're not usually like this.

479
33:09.370 --> 33:11.150
This is not you at all.

480
33:11.590 --> 33:12.930
You don't seem like yourself.

481
33:14.520 --> 33:16.710
It seems like you're drunk.

482
33:17.000 --> 33:18.330
I'm not even drunk.

483
33:18.350 --> 33:20.130
I've only had one glass of beer.

484
33:21.970 --> 33:23.570
Beer.

485
33:24.240 --> 33:25.050
Beer?

486
33:25.710 --> 33:29.250
The Black Bull drug has effects similar to a date rape drug.

487
33:29.660 --> 33:32.720
Initially, it causes intoxication.

488
33:33.080 --> 33:34.340
But after a while,

489
33:34.920 --> 33:38.450
it triggers an uncontrollable, intense sexual arousal.

490
33:39.680 --> 33:40.470
Hold up.

491
33:41.040 --> 33:42.590
I think you've been drugged.

492
33:42.700 --> 33:46.960
Your symptoms are definitely caused by that Black Bull drug.

493
33:48.450 --> 33:49.480
Drugged?

494
33:49.990 --> 33:51.650
Am I going to be okay?

495
33:51.970 --> 33:54.470
You're going to be fine.

496
33:54.750 --> 33:56.190
I'll take care of you.

497
33:57.000 --> 33:58.570
Let's head home first.

498
33:58.780 --> 34:00.790
I'll tell the others you're not feeling well.

499
34:01.000 --> 34:02.370
Okay?

500
34:03.400 --> 34:04.240
Okay.

501
34:05.960 --> 34:06.610
Okay.

502
34:06.700 --> 34:07.530
That's better.

503
34:08.040 --> 34:08.710
Let's go.

504
34:17.210 --> 34:18.380
Watch your step.

505
34:22.470 --> 34:23.160
Come on.

506
34:25.910 --> 34:27.460
Sit here for a moment.

507
34:27.970 --> 34:30.220
Let me call Nadol first.

508
34:30.520 --> 34:31.620
I'll get you some water.

509
34:32.960 --> 34:33.860
Stay right here.

510
34:34.050 --> 34:34.620
Alright.

511
34:34.640 --> 34:35.280
Okay.

512
34:51.000 --> 34:53.570
Hello, Nadol. I need some advice.

513
34:54.350 --> 34:56.550
Someone I know might have been drugged with the Black Bull drug.

514
34:56.860 --> 34:58.090
Is there any way to help with it?

515
34:59.240 --> 35:01.110
(You have to help them stay conscious.)

516
35:01.320 --> 35:02.600
(Give them some cold water to drink.)

517
35:02.890 --> 35:06.350
(Maybe have them take a shower, soak in the tub, and get some rest.)

518
35:06.720 --> 35:08.350
(But you have to be careful)

519
35:08.380 --> 35:09.830
(because once the drug takes effect,)

520
35:10.250 --> 35:11.440
(it can be quite intense.)

521
35:12.000 --> 35:13.320
Why can it be intense?

522
35:15.250 --> 35:19.810
(It'll cause them to release all their pent-up emotions.)

523
35:21.220 --> 35:22.500
What kind of emotions?

524
35:23.100 --> 35:24.300
(Sexual desires.)

525
36:37.610 --> 36:38.600
Mungkorn.

526
36:39.600 --> 36:41.370
Where did you go? I told you to wait here.

527
36:48.470 --> 36:49.120
Sh*t.

528
36:52.500 --> 36:53.940
What have you been doing?

529
36:54.890 --> 36:56.250
I just went to the toilet.

530
36:57.600 --> 36:58.760
Oh, okay.

531
36:59.200 --> 37:00.730
I've talked with Nadol.

532
37:00.760 --> 37:03.410
He said drinking plenty of water is the way to go.

533
37:04.070 --> 37:04.870
Here you go.

534
37:09.160 --> 37:10.060
Sure.

535
37:13.370 --> 37:14.970
I'll drink lots of water.

536
37:16.570 --> 37:18.330
Just as you said, Inspector.

537
37:31.540 --> 37:32.500
Hey, wait.

538
37:34.140 --> 37:35.550
Why are you spilling it everywhere?

539
37:43.350 --> 37:44.680
I'm just a little too thirsty.

540
37:45.700 --> 37:46.820
My shirt is all soaked.

541
37:48.650 --> 37:50.290
Let me take it off then.

542
37:54.250 --> 37:55.210
Hey.

543
37:59.960 --> 38:03.970
I think we'd better head to the bedroom.

544
38:04.360 --> 38:05.020
Let's go.

545
38:05.280 --> 38:06.760
I'm not really sleepy.

546
38:07.800 --> 38:09.830
I'd rather do something fun instead.

547
38:09.850 --> 38:11.730
What are you doing?

548
38:12.420 --> 38:14.960
What do husbands usually do?

549
38:16.750 --> 38:19.160
We were only faking it last time.

550
38:20.330 --> 38:22.100
Maybe we should make it real.

551
38:22.710 --> 38:23.310
Wait, wait.

552
38:23.320 --> 38:24.290
Mung...

553
38:33.890 --> 38:34.830
Mungkorn.

554
38:36.440 --> 38:37.390
Hey.

555
38:37.820 --> 38:39.070
I think...

556
38:40.620 --> 38:42.420
the drug is really kicking in now.

557
38:43.310 --> 38:44.870
It has nothing to do with the drug.

558
38:45.930 --> 38:47.940
I'm simply following my heart.

559
38:50.940 --> 38:52.230
Seductive like this...

560
38:52.530 --> 38:54.290
Don't you like it?

561
38:55.640 --> 38:56.500
I like it.

562
38:56.970 --> 38:58.390
I like it, but...

563
38:58.410 --> 38:58.990
Mung...

564
39:03.660 --> 39:04.970
If you want me to get even wilder,

565
39:05.740 --> 39:07.330
I'll give you exactly what you want.

566
39:16.640 --> 39:18.350
We should stop.

567
39:18.700 --> 39:19.880
I don't think this is right.

568
39:20.140 --> 39:21.740
This is clearly the drug talking.

569
39:22.200 --> 39:24.720
Are you ready to see fiery Mungkorn?

570
39:25.040 --> 39:26.580
I really like this.

571
39:27.310 --> 39:28.700
This version of you.

572
39:29.790 --> 39:32.570
Can I get something even wilder?

573
39:33.370 --> 39:34.000
Mungkorn.

574
39:34.540 --> 39:36.140
The drug's taken over you.

575
39:39.730 --> 39:41.070
I'm not high.

576
39:42.790 --> 39:43.590
I...

577
40:10.570 --> 40:11.830
I can't hold back anymore.

578
40:12.080 --> 40:13.610
We have to do it right now.

579
40:13.630 --> 40:15.710
We can't do that, not right now.

580
40:15.740 --> 40:16.860
You're under the influence.

581
40:16.990 --> 40:18.350
If not now, then when?

582
40:18.650 --> 40:19.840
Don't be too stubborn.

583
40:19.860 --> 40:22.190
No, wait. It's not right.

584
40:22.320 --> 40:24.070
No! Whoa, Mungkorn!

585
40:24.190 --> 40:25.990
Hold on, we can't. Trust me.

586
40:26.070 --> 40:27.290
Hey!

587
40:34.810 --> 40:35.920
Mungkorn.

588
40:36.040 --> 40:37.770
Listen to me.

589
40:40.250 --> 40:41.110
Just listen to me.

590
40:42.800 --> 40:43.900
How about this?

591
40:45.620 --> 40:48.040
Why don't we do it in the room instead?

592
40:48.840 --> 40:50.760
If someone walks by,

593
40:51.510 --> 40:52.640
it won't look good.

594
40:53.490 --> 40:54.920
I'm not ashamed at all.

595
40:55.520 --> 40:56.870
I want to do it right now.

596
40:57.040 --> 40:57.780
Mungkorn.

597
40:58.920 --> 41:00.250
But I'm too stingy.

598
41:01.630 --> 41:03.610
I can't have anyone seeing you naked.

599
41:04.390 --> 41:05.340
I wouldn't be able to stand it.

600
41:05.800 --> 41:06.910
I want you all to myself.

601
41:20.500 --> 41:21.960
I'm going to make tonight

602
41:22.670 --> 41:25.040
truly special.

603
41:46.700 --> 41:48.410
Sit here first.

604
41:56.650 --> 41:58.720
Why don't we do it on the bed?

605
41:59.400 --> 42:00.430
What are we doing here?

606
42:03.300 --> 42:04.970
We need to make it more exciting.

607
42:05.380 --> 42:07.350
Let's do it in the tub instead, okay?

608
42:08.310 --> 42:09.790
But it's cold.

609
42:12.460 --> 42:15.600
It's okay. I'll warm you right up.

610
42:21.560 --> 42:22.750
Wait, hold on.

611
42:22.990 --> 42:23.700
Mungkorn.

612
42:27.090 --> 42:29.060
Don't you want to kiss me?

613
42:31.310 --> 42:32.710
Am I not cute enough?

614
42:36.870 --> 42:37.910
Of course you are.

615
42:38.600 --> 42:40.770
You're the cutest person I know.

616
42:41.330 --> 42:42.760
If I'm cute, then kiss me.

617
42:43.180 --> 42:44.270
Hold up.

618
42:48.320 --> 42:49.110
Look.

619
42:49.840 --> 42:51.390
We shouldn't be doing this

620
42:52.360 --> 42:55.240
while you're unconscious.

621
42:59.330 --> 43:01.110
Then what do I have to do

622
43:01.680 --> 43:03.510
to please you?

623
43:05.070 --> 43:06.480
Could you tell me?

624
43:08.260 --> 43:09.620
Listen to me.

625
43:10.400 --> 43:11.680
You don't have to do anything.

626
43:13.300 --> 43:14.960
I like you just the way you are.

627
43:18.610 --> 43:20.260
I'll run the water for you.

628
43:27.350 --> 43:28.820
Come on, stand up.

629
45:06.600 --> 45:08.480
Let's go in the tub, okay?

630
45:24.930 --> 45:26.110
Inspector,

631
45:27.310 --> 45:29.120
I feel like I have no strength left.

632
45:31.310 --> 45:32.270
It's okay.

633
45:33.620 --> 45:34.920
You can just fall asleep if you want.

634
45:35.130 --> 45:36.650
I'll look after you.

635
46:36.180 --> 46:37.550
You're up, honey?

636
46:37.570 --> 46:39.520
You were pretty naughty last night.

637
46:39.540 --> 46:41.470
So you're my first?

638
46:41.510 --> 46:43.510
I was more than happy to be.

639
46:46.540 --> 46:47.650
What the f*ck are you doing?

640
46:47.720 --> 46:50.740
Tonight's gonna be a good time.

641
46:54.200 --> 46:55.000
Hey!

642
46:55.130 --> 46:56.190
What are you doing?

643
46:58.790 --> 47:03.700
♪Trying so hard not to cross the line,♪

644
47:03.730 --> 47:08.560
♪But the more I run, the more you're on my mind♪

645
47:08.590 --> 47:12.860
♪If you're gonna love me, don't break the deal we made♪

646
47:12.890 --> 47:18.410
♪Don't break my heart, remember what you said?♪

647
47:18.440 --> 47:23.310
♪Let's call off the deal and let our hearts decide♪

648
47:23.340 --> 47:29.770
♪From contracting parties to lovers, does that sound alright?♪

649
47:35.970 --> 47:39.500
♪It's time you became mine♪
